okanāthassa sāsanaṁ.", "Ogāhetvā visuddhāya, sīlādipaṭipattiyā.", "Sabbepi dehino hontu, vimuttirasabhāgino.", "Ciraṁ tiṭṭhatu lokasmiṁ, Sammāsambuddhasāsanaṁ.", "Tasmiṁ sagāravā niccaṁ, hontu sabbepi4 pāṇino.", "Sammā vassatu kālena, devopi jagatīpati1.", "Saddhammanirato lokaṁ, dhammeneva pasāsatūti.", "Iti Badaratitthavihāravāsinā Munivarayatinā", "Bhadantena Ācariyadhammapālena katā"], "app": []}, {"label": null, "lines": ["Petavatthu-atthasaṁvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."], "app": []}, {"label": null, "lines": ["Petavatthu-aṭṭhakathā samattā."], "app": []}]}